# Pre-Write utils checklist (mandatory)

When you are about to **Write / StrReplace / EditNotebook** under **`remindWritePaths`** (default `src/feature`, `src/components`, `src/hooks`, `src/views`) or **`utilsDir`**, and the change **imports or calls `@/utils`** (or adds util-semantics local helpers):

## HARD STOP — Read / search / gen index ≠ gate complete

**Do not call Write tools** until **all** are true — **unless session Verdict already covers patch symbols** (Hook `alreadyCovered`; see `.cursor/.utils-gate-verdict.json`):

1. **Confirm per symbol** — legacy (1–2): individual Q1–Q4; **bulk compact (≥3)**: `| Symbol | Read @ path | Q4 | Verdict |`; **delta (v0.3.11)**: only new symbol rows + `Gate N/A — <block>` — **not** `Q1-Q5 通过`
2. **`Verdict（最终）`** with reuse / newUtil / **noUtil** / featureLocal / **partialReuse**
3. **First Write in this response** OR **session audit already recorded** with matching symbols — same turn: table before Write tool call
4. **Read util source export(s)** you will call — **forbidden**: Confirm from index summary or feature call sites only
5. Pure UI / template-style-only patch → **`Gate N/A`** or Hook uiOnly allow (no full re-Confirm)
6. **>5 reuse symbols** → prefer split batches (≤5 symbol Confirm + Write per round)

**Anti-loop (v0.3.14)**: If bulk table + `Verdict（最终）` already in chat or session audit → **Write**; on deny read **`denyReason`** — do NOT re-print identical Confirm. Forbidden meta: 「下面先给出 Confirm」.

If any is false → output Discovery + bulk table + Verdict first, **then** Write (same response). No user "继续" required.

With **`hookMode: confirm`** (opt-in), deny includes **`verdict_missing_empty_payload`**, **`verdict_not_substantive`**, **`missing_reads`**, **`staleSymbols`**, **`missing_agents_read`**, **`sibling_q4_missing`**, **`bulk_row_invalid`**, **`bulk_read_not_in_session`**, **`noutil_q4_invalid`**, plus **`sessionVerdictRecorded`** / **`alreadyCovered`**. Deny JSON in `agent_message`. Default **`hookMode: off`** — Rules-only.

Details: `.cursor/rules/utils-reuse-gate.mdc`, `docs/agent-catalog/placement-decision.md` §1.6.
